# Alembic migration versions
#
# This directory holds the generated migration scripts.
# Each file is named  <revision_id>_<description>.py  and is created by:
#
#   alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"
#
# IMPORTANT: Review every auto-generated migration before committing it.
# Alembic does not detect every change (e.g. server_default, partial indexes,
# CHECK constraints) — add those manually.
#
# Apply pending migrations:
#   alembic upgrade head
#
# Roll back the last migration:
#   alembic downgrade -1
